{"id": "clm:58b1fb8fbb895615303f6b4927665d550fa833ed556ae7265a391a341ce5501f", "type": "statement", "text": "Attributed event-name conflict: the Omni guide’s Apex introductory prose says `AgentWorkPresenceChangeEvent`, while its Apex trigger declaration and channel-member XML use `AgentWorkChangeEvent`. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/service/service-presence-developer-guide/guide/omnichannel-external-routing-subscribe-to-change-data-capture-event-notificat.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2a7be76c2b189603f675ceee58d8d0d6004e5814c12e4768a5994215eaa2528a", "ev:4730b5d61576640946d420c6e1a5f34b4b1c83841a1b56614eef6222d1a12c0a", "ev:b09e1e9e770443e01e9043ea09e60aada10cdd5ddf024151c2ab344e8a8c43d5"]}
{"id": "clm:6062bbe4af3f74c1387b54c5ae94bc96cfcba62a77d9c5922a1d9ba4b7e553ea", "type": "statement", "text": "Design inference, proposed capability step: call GetTopic for the candidate topic under the intended authentication context; compare returned topic_name and tenant_guid with the expected identity, record can_subscribe and can_publish separately, and retain schema_id and rpc_id. Treat a false subscription flag as a failed capability check, not as proof of a particular permission cause. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/gettopic-rpc.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2146c6e009c2fee77a9ca927f05edd6e204c983df6ed2fed89d8c6e4ea8cfb60", "ev:358ea9b20bcbaf5a9df1491107a13ec9d87da2485b610ecd5b1d9821fa51c366", "ev:edb79f0ebfd6a644ad7db98e27b581aaf7bafb3cbd54c05668af460556809268"]}
{"id": "clm:fac1fc4fdf1802cec3e84e37fa5289ef13c2feb132561a72ccb16c056cb2087b", "type": "statement", "text": "Pub/Sub error inspection exposes a gRPC status and description/details, a custom error code in exception trailers, and an RPC ID in the message and trailers. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6d2476dd12ee263c7fb1cad9f210a71f84b3c32802eac038ad0dcb27bfff6b27", "ev:b0862932470af40703bd25fe9778ffc5c543891e5c02f0eb9af3ca903de7d20a"]}
{"id": "clm:bcf4fda290d3bad2895c1c5e5e31439017a6025236f22bfcc90c95f05fb62937", "type": "statement", "text": "The documented topic error sfdc.platform.eventbus.grpc.topic.meta.permission maps to PERMISSION_DENIED: An error occurred while getting the metadata for the specified topic. Ensure the credentials and topic name are correct. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:63e7d6a759c65d71a9c23eae5170416a9b3592cd77172c49e66a91cedf9c292e"]}
{"id": "clm:c79166e5f3e26fef6240925bef9bbf193734ff8c6b4ea5f42256b7dbaa338c7d", "type": "statement", "text": "The documented topic error sfdc.platform.eventbus.grpc.topic.not.found maps to NOT_FOUND: The topic information for the specified topic wasn’t found. Ensure that the topic name is correct and the topic exists. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:e262531fc727d67eaed1247d2d3aab3ddcb96a3ebb9cf187776ff01b582f8824"]}
{"id": "clm:25f3d3cf4b12a71e4073d51231345e4d305f665e4f2bfb4ae0dd157fa0f02272", "type": "statement", "text": "The documented topic error sfdc.platform.eventbus.grpc.topic.api.unavailable maps to UNAVAILABLE: The topic information is unavailable for the specified topic. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:df6cf7c2ec960fcceed53111ce5d374128a613ba5963400f534de2cbd32d6960"]}
{"id": "clm:0657d3df04e58269fdd0cfd86e9e98817430eb62df644727f5bbb770787f816c", "type": "statement", "text": "The documented topic error sfdc.platform.eventbus.grpc.topic.validation.empty maps to INVALID_ARGUMENT: An error occurred while validating the topic information provided. The topic can’t be blank. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:cf7bb43737de56a1b287c659eb482afa34af4ca25652565238f634a29189d9f7"]}
{"id": "clm:5fe90ead2347b4b4def175ccd264bba6b077784d1cf158e1ed8afdef7209c509", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: on topic-lookup failure, preserve the gRPC status, custom error code, and RPC ID; classify blank input, missing topic, metadata-permission failure, and unavailable information separately. Correct or investigate the indicated cause before repeating the lookup; a failure does not justify rewriting the configured topic automatically. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-filter-subscribe.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:63e7d6a759c65d71a9c23eae5170416a9b3592cd77172c49e66a91cedf9c292e", "ev:6d2476dd12ee263c7fb1cad9f210a71f84b3c32802eac038ad0dcb27bfff6b27", "ev:b4fecac35652bae53a782125802157d867e4f088cf9562ce7f70d54fac7c284c", "ev:cf7bb43737de56a1b287c659eb482afa34af4ca25652565238f634a29189d9f7", "ev:df6cf7c2ec960fcceed53111ce5d374128a613ba5963400f534de2cbd32d6960", "ev:e1ca54827acf021673c0868db7b0fc4a1f77cb13fc6501e2f014c983cdc941f7", "ev:e262531fc727d67eaed1247d2d3aab3ddcb96a3ebb9cf187776ff01b582f8824"]}
{"id": "clm:9ff4443ebe017783732c170974dda916d5f1392361af860881fc5e29524a6899", "type": "statement", "text": "Design inference, proposed error-handling step: record status, custom trailer error code, and RPC ID. On topic metadata permission failure, recheck both credentials and topic name; on not-found, recheck the name and existence; on empty-topic validation failure, fix the input; on unavailable-topic information, classify validation as inconclusive and retry under an operational retry policy. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/gettopic-rpc.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0b9c58bb4206f01332726a5d3efa5308e7573da79c1c1d59013a6458965e6a3f", "ev:2146c6e009c2fee77a9ca927f05edd6e204c983df6ed2fed89d8c6e4ea8cfb60", "ev:8c4174735eb8e16861263b826a0a38ab860629177a1e68ad5b0844b79ceb7be3", "ev:c7324a94349250474c100d8b54e6dd0cbfdacdafda16add6d6c6bb8338ec6724"]}
{"id": "clm:ca96d5bdb1c0cf30ad76f5e97202107dd224ea16cca93d3b48e7491d577ddf0d", "type": "statement", "text": "The subscription error sfdc.platform.eventbus.grpc.subscription.topic.cannot.subscribe maps to PERMISSION_DENIED and directs the caller to check required permissions. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/guide/handling-errors.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2262818ef5919cc0418fcbe8ed730326b13bca7bf2bfb39bbe0077a3cd4cfb88"]}
{"id": "clm:61320e4151421156229b4e55a8e92d26db044885ff0fd93c4ac89dedb26988d7", "type": "statement", "text": "Attributed naming conflict: the Omni guide gives the subscription setting /data/ExternalRoutingChannel_chn, while its member XML uses ExternalRoutingChannel__chn and the CDC subscription guide specifies /data/ChannelName__chn. Preserve these spellings as source positions rather than silently correcting the Omni text. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/service/service-presence-developer-guide/guide/omnichannel-external-routing-subscribe-to-change-data-capture-event-notificat.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-filter-subscribe.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:419577fa7ac1c3a0c2f9a16b89786cce252e4388794da317bf797f7e2633e231", "ev:52e39db4eae669c6f07e216b71bb5a9cd032ef1bf96ec27e36ce58bffaa74b4e", "ev:b4fecac35652bae53a782125802157d867e4f088cf9562ce7f70d54fac7c284c"]}
{"id": "clm:f65dc1c87b43af9d6ce189ac158a6b592298be55602a7fa0a23179757e4b966f", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: inspect each associated member individually for `SelectedEntity`, `FilterExpression`, `FullName`, and `Metadata`; compare the selected entities and predicates with the intended contract. When the Omni sample is the contract, retain its literal presence predicate rather than rewriting OR as AND. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannelmember.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/service/service-presence-developer-guide/guide/omnichannel-external-routing-subscribe-to-change-data-capture-event-notificat.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3c00e456a4a99b527b3fa6607efebd1432e6c83cdbab310cc39ab3c05477b0a5", "ev:4562a52b7b7fef51fc35668a7d7a0ac3c92ed04a7a0c404efae1f9f772c44e9e", "ev:c55ad2575e989b742b375ab6140dcd2beb2de4e80db610749b2ac9631cba5a6f", "ev:d62a4f9e5511bb38fede556dd19192c40589baa225140eed19ddba2ac219ff63", "ev:eacb52265941f83858bbf0150012b243ed760af73afc0a7d181215de18af21ba"]}
{"id": "clm:5dde7277681282607735205d72a3fa17f9593c9c741582c253c9d5a1ae641b81", "type": "statement", "text": "Design inference, proposed identity step: form the candidate topic by prefixing the retrieved channel FullName with /data/, retaining its namespace and __chn suffix. Record the Omni single-underscore subscription spelling as a discrepancy to resolve, rather than deriving a topic from the member DeveloperName. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannel.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannelmember.html", "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-filter-subscribe.html", "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/service/service-presence-developer-guide/guide/omnichannel-external-routing-subscribe-to-change-data-capture-event-notificat.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:419577fa7ac1c3a0c2f9a16b89786cce252e4388794da317bf797f7e2633e231", "ev:7a346bb55f2c7fcb0180b20a073cdbd439192eb861aa862d06e18030a4ce5d85", "ev:b4fecac35652bae53a782125802157d867e4f088cf9562ce7f70d54fac7c284c", "ev:b5b4e12295e38c47938218e5f826dc6f47d16c444217b01c85ac3aceada21ba1"]}
{"id": "clm:0c3d41b41fb1cb3c7a87afd2c919dc554913f6b79f80bc265404ad8a0b3c4fac", "type": "statement", "text": "The documented Omni example selects UserServicePresenceChangeEvent on ExternalRoutingChannel__chn and uses exactly: ChangeEventHeader.changeType = 'CREATE' OR (IsCurrentState = false). This is the documented example, including OR and parentheses. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/service/service-presence-developer-guide/guide/omnichannel-external-routing-subscribe-to-change-data-capture-event-notificat.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-event-fields-header.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2db0b6c7f0263f1d2b85c476aabf92fd0ca7be020aa93fa9551f90839b6949f7", "ev:bf6c3c33ef5d3e2861c68953454ce5842405dd10f3906057157f8007f64bd76c"]}
{"id": "clm:eafbb75d021ec88f6973520e19aeb159cb12adb9e28db18cab0d6f203153e422", "type": "statement", "text": "The Omni example for PendingServiceRoutingChangeEvent uses RoutingModel = 'ExternalRouting' AND IsReadyForRouting = true. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/service/service-presence-developer-guide/guide/omnichannel-external-routing-subscribe-to-change-data-capture-event-notificat.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:602fee8d811b223d01bd852d140b00afa46807d32705c76ef1465956b8de9ae1"]}
