{"id": "clm:4cfd92d004c14391cd2fb856786a353627c720231364cd50a6f1432b691645cf", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: retrieve the selected channel’s `FullName` and `Metadata` using a query restricted to that individual record; preserve any namespace in the returned full name. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannel.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:94ad3923a9e2266236f8b72eea30d04e231ba6557e2c09c16595b20ed59aa5bf", "ev:acb4158a1a40535c805d844a4072be5c9ec8d7473dfde09c3e8a7770b347e6f1"]}
{"id": "clm:04b2220f158cf4ea84b18bbfe4972ddebd3e0d72010c2ed4ae963cfa13b0d03a", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: use the member discovery query and associate custom-channel members by matching the returned `EventChannel` ID to the chosen channel ID. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannelmember.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0cd4ec3ccedfce0c5eb9d72f292da9be9aba9c1120e9fd1257952b0b0f5f583b", "ev:cf548b8e6c1642abfe4917f8743a16711f8f169dd25f46d1b071dec816e153dc"]}
{"id": "clm:070a611edfcfcdb265a21a3c1667ae63ca2b6c988e55995b12516a722db9110f", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: use the documented `/data/ChannelName__chn` format with the selected channel's full name, including its namespace and suffix, then send that exact candidate to `GetTopic`. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannel.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-filter-subscribe.html", "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/gettopic-rpc.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1fd16a7dc9d4d6d2544f066bf3924976e4c7517923ccc21d848182ddb80fb94f", "ev:787147b6104df7ee5fe4895d8a877ccd59cb59896b83bd4e8ba9456b0dc0c566", "ev:acb4158a1a40535c805d844a4072be5c9ec8d7473dfde09c3e8a7770b347e6f1", "ev:b4fecac35652bae53a782125802157d867e4f088cf9562ce7f70d54fac7c284c"]}
{"id": "clm:5637a4150a665d25a717620b916464e212015c9b37f64279af1ed927cb64403e", "type": "statement", "text": "GetTopic receives TopicRequest and returns TopicInfo. TopicRequest's topic_name field specifies the topic; the authentication headers implicitly identify the tenant/org. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/gettopic-rpc.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2146c6e009c2fee77a9ca927f05edd6e204c983df6ed2fed89d8c6e4ea8cfb60", "ev:358ea9b20bcbaf5a9df1491107a13ec9d87da2485b610ecd5b1d9821fa51c366"]}
{"id": "clm:f630eef11b0aca4df29ec9d3b5fa8e5c8f24e8f875ddd64ee2f1e3d81a3032b8", "type": "statement", "text": "The primary protocol requires RPC authentication metadata headers `accesstoken`, `instanceurl`, and `tenantid` for Salesforce session-token authentication. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6d4fc3f294317166fa5c021f680ea1f3a6512fdd558ad38405046e30e1e71634"]}
{"id": "clm:40a713cdbd6caadb543f3c229bed4de1d2976947d8c416b4a2bf002079cec9f8", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: use an explicitly identified intended org and principal for the metadata reads and the authenticated topic lookup, and record that context with the comparison; no target-org execution is implied by this proposal. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannel.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2efae722595375ebc9dab9e03bf0c83b2f548225dca8d8925597f72dfdb93a2b", "ev:b1631d7ef815a83e1c3d153a4028e3094c112b76d3fff9c02d892aa722c24078", "ev:d76e1f4c56a1ec4833f0eea30c5cdea6ad5c4fd27c3418a58f43ce48c5b615e6"]}
{"id": "clm:44f6c1d6f5bdd55d4adf21b81a64b162d6906ebd7ca14cf7bfca1c86fc5b0fa7", "type": "statement", "text": "TopicInfo defines topic_name, tenant_guid, can_publish, can_subscribe, schema_id, and rpc_id. The protocol describes can_publish as whether publishing is allowed and can_subscribe as whether subscription is allowed. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:edb79f0ebfd6a644ad7db98e27b581aaf7bafb3cbd54c05668af460556809268"]}
{"id": "clm:6ca43b1911eb68ed8a860b8a1e83e9e6ab99c28486fed53e68756e7524cab1c7", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: compare returned `topic_name` with the requested topic, record `tenant_guid`, and require `can_subscribe` before considering the subscription-capability check successful. Record `can_publish` separately without making publishing a prerequisite for this read-only procedure. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/gettopic-rpc.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:130138fcec04096c8919c42ea5e2657110515f8b6e09014ec3f330f048c2775b", "ev:358ea9b20bcbaf5a9df1491107a13ec9d87da2485b610ecd5b1d9821fa51c366", "ev:6788cccbdbb654e298de20403cbe3ba55d01d2a12347c599e2871bac7391dc76"]}
