{"id": "clm:7ab1aa264323d6bdf6309411d105d5af7f2e391ea04c7695e314f477c97f2cab", "type": "statement", "text": "Proposed read-only procedure, design inference: record `schema_id` and `rpc_id`; optionally use the returned schema ID for a schema-information lookup as a separate diagnostic step. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/gettopic-rpc.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6788cccbdbb654e298de20403cbe3ba55d01d2a12347c599e2871bac7391dc76", "ev:a682c9c7307d81ac9520c76240c289ef033a4a6ba346d46e87dc54c992d724cc"]}
{"id": "clm:fc62094d4f5b95dca4b3d905468c6c45019486bddb05d53d38d25ca2ca1f9219", "type": "statement", "text": "Design inference, verification boundary: successful topic-information lookup and capability inspection establish only the returned metadata and flags in that authentication context. They do not establish actual event delivery or filter-predicate correctness; assess delivery separately with an explicitly authorized subscription and representative events. This proposed procedure ends after read-only metadata/RPC checks and makes no target-org assertion. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forcedotcom/pub-sub-api/main/pubsub_api.proto", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/pub-sub-api/references/methods/gettopic-rpc.html", "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/change-data-capture/guide/cdc-filter-subscribe.html", "https://www.outofmemo.com/articles/salesforce-create-filtered-cdc-channel-platformeventchannel"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2146c6e009c2fee77a9ca927f05edd6e204c983df6ed2fed89d8c6e4ea8cfb60", "ev:358ea9b20bcbaf5a9df1491107a13ec9d87da2485b610ecd5b1d9821fa51c366", "ev:41cb4251cce5311c8266b2b866a6fa8a4aa2afbb61057ba1b160f9edbde4b745", "ev:ad439edc48851f6a450e7e4764e93c9b43d7e0d7390a895fe0a8781cff82c076", "ev:ba59f2ac03245ee89f2172a1d7ff12b026962466264f458cd65bfffbc58c649b", "ev:edb79f0ebfd6a644ad7db98e27b581aaf7bafb3cbd54c05668af460556809268", "ev:f4156d64c60f4c89b44dd700a3ce3d341c7abe1319f0a40bd8f594335faf9d5d"]}
