{"id": "clm:7792ce9a0bf693292442b1a149933da0494f1182e173c1b1b0dd4dccef212bd8", "type": "statement", "text": "A CDC custom channel uses channel type data; channel members associate change-event entities with that channel. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannel.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannelmember.html", "https://www.outofmemo.com/articles/salesforce-create-filtered-cdc-channel-platformeventchannel"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:707a701de6244d9cabd6151906ee59afd1484fc3c52a29cc792a782746cbbae1", "ev:9b82e9ffccf9cb54970a6db9f4c92301266bc93863ed82b9703ef92187df4b61", "ev:ae07f5e427afc66ea62a4538fb9200bc849072f885c983df86232110c74e5255", "ev:c497e7c53d6c17b3574cc4d5cdb41b74a505081e33318ae479b18cf35d2e821f", "ev:d7ce5fbb9bf80df2738b597418dc2c0e7e91cf48d5061162afee90912e55cdfb"]}
{"id": "clm:4ed9145e665bd949f2a1b78fc28aaeb38d9a9892eb47a282da34334f14f55d26", "type": "statement", "text": "Design inference, proposed read-only step: enumerate channels and members with the documented Tooling queries, then join each custom member EventChannel ID to its channel Id before assessing the selected entity and channel type. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannel.html", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Salesforce Omni-Channel CDC channel configuration and topic validation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/platform/api-tooling/references/tooling-objects/tooling-platformeventchannelmember.html"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:b70d3e78ae72ce6183f23b4ab5ee8326887b2d9b350403224489cbac061e80e3", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0cd4ec3ccedfce0c5eb9d72f292da9be9aba9c1120e9fd1257952b0b0f5f583b", "ev:cf548b8e6c1642abfe4917f8743a16711f8f169dd25f46d1b071dec816e153dc", "ev:d4aaf02756a5ed4db5b76adc6c05a385c4d6001ae6e333ea2237ab587723f749"]}
